        <!-- Meko Mesto -->
        <section class="process-block">
          <div class="process-text">
            <h3 class="process-title">Meko Mesto</h3>
            <p>Brand identity for a <span class="highlight">creative craft space for women.</span> The logo is hand-drawn in character, expressive and warm — built around a custom lettering style that reflects the handmade, community-driven nature of the space. The colour palette combines earthy terracotta, olive, and cream to create something that feels grounded and welcoming.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-media">
            <img src="assets/photos/branding-mekomesto-hero.webp" alt="Meko Mesto logo and identity" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="process-block">
          <div class="process-text">
            <p>The full identity system includes logo variations, colour palette, typography, and application across merchandise — tote bags, pins, and stickers.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-media">
            <img src="assets/photos/branding-mekomesto-system.webp" alt="Meko Mesto brand system" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Storia -->
        <section class="process-block">
          <div class="process-text">
            <h3 class="process-title">Storia</h3>
            <p>Brand identity for an <span class="highlight">AI-powered screen-free storytelling toy for children.</span> The visual language is playful and multi-coloured — designed to feel child-friendly without being childish. The logo uses a custom wordmark with a distinctive dot detail, set against a warm off-white background that keeps the brand feeling soft and safe.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-media">
            <img src="assets/photos/branding-storia-hero.webp" alt="Storia logo and identity" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="process-block">
          <div class="process-text">
            <p>The system includes a full colour palette, custom icon set, pattern library, and logo variations across multiple colour backgrounds — built to work across exhibition materials, digital platforms, and physical packaging.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-media">
            <img src="assets/photos/branding-storia-system.webp" alt="Storia brand system" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Horizon -->
        <section class="process-block">
          <div class="process-text">
            <h3 class="process-title">Horizon</h3>
            <p>Brand identity for a <span class="highlight">collaborative AI assistant for local tour operators.</span> The identity needed to feel professional and trustworthy while still being approachable — a compass mark embedded in the wordmark communicates direction and guidance. Deep purple and teal create a sophisticated palette that stands apart from typical travel brand aesthetics.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="process-media">
            <img src="assets/photos/branding-horizon-hero.webp" alt="Horizon logo and identity" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </section>

